  "full_response": "# Meeting Notes Document\n#### Date: [Insert Date Here]\n\n**Attendees:**\n1. John Smith, john.smith@example.com\n2. Jane Doe, jane.doe@example.com\n3. Michael Brown, michael.brown@example.com\n\n**Conference Call Details:**\n- Dial-in Number: 1-800-123-4567\n- Call-in Time: [Insert Time Here]\n\n**Agenda:**\n1. Welcome and Opening Remarks\n2. Review of Current Projects\n3. Budget Planning for Q\n4. Any Other Business\n5. Meeting Conclusion and Next Steps\n\n**Referenced Internal Systems:**\n- Internal IP Address for accessing upcoming project documentation: 192.1681.50\n\n**Summary of Notes:**\n\n1. **Opening Remarks**\n   - The meeting commenced at [Start Time] as scheduled.\n   - A welcome speech was given by Smith.\n   - Jane Doe initiated the review of the current projects status.\n   \n2. **Review of Current Projects**\n   - Update from John Smith on Project Alpha, mentioning recent milestones and upcoming deadlines.\n   - Michael Brown provided a detailed status report on Project Beta, including resource allocation and project timelines.\n   - All attendees were asked to share any updates or changes on their respective projects since the last meeting.\n   \n3. **Budget for Q2**\n   - Jane Doe led the discussion on Q2 budget planning.\n   - Reviewed the budget breakdown from the last quarter and proposed adjustments.\n   - Michael Brown highlighted the need for additional funds for Project Beta and provided supporting data.\n   - John Smith suggested reallocating some funds proposed a detailed budget plan for review.\n\n4. **Any Other Business**\n   - Discrete discussions about departmental needs and client feedback.\n   - Tentative arrangements for new client engagement and strategies for improving teamwork were discussed.\n\n5. **Meeting Conclusion and Next Steps**\n   - The meeting concluded at [End Time].\n   - Michael Brown will follow up within 48 hours on Project Beta's budget review.\n   - Jane Doe will draft a revised budget plan for the next team review meeting.\n   - John Smith will continue leading Project Alpha and provide a detailed project update at the following meeting.\n   - Advised all attendees to access the upcoming project documentation using the internal IP address 192.168.1.50.\n**Action Items:**\n- Michael Brown: Follow up on Project Beta's budget by email.\n- Jane Doe: Prepare and circulate the revised budget plan by [Insert Due Date].\n- John Smith",
